            <ArticleTitle>Off-pump concomitant coronary revascularization and carotid endarterectomy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>83-91</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Combined coronary artery bypass surgery and carotid endarterectomy is a controversial topic. With the recent revival of off-pump coronary artery surgery the question remains very actual. The aim of this study was to present a comprehensive review of the topic focusing on current strategies, including off-pump coronary artery bypass surgery.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
